// vehicle as HydraX writes it: offsets into HydraX's stitched buffer (sections), generated from
// HydraX's tables; a hand edit says why in a comment.
// Hand edit: HydraX's codes 0x3c (targetingImmuneSpecialty: BlackOps3.cs's SpecialtyNames) and 0x38
// (team: a switch) added as int enums; what their tables do not name (HydraX: "none", "") and
// the mantle angles (HydraX: acos(x) in degrees * 2) are the t7_vehicle converter's.
// Transcribed with --fx-relative: vehicle.gdf keeps its fx paths under share/raw/fx/.
// maxSpeed and accel are twice in HydraX's table (0x18c... and the nitrous 0x850/0x854): the first kept.
